输出：{"domain": "vod", "intent": "slow_search", "tool": "vod_slow_search_data_search", "confidence": 0.9}

用户请求：超高清电视节目
输出：{"domain": "vod", "intent": "slow_search", "tool": "vod_slow_search_data_search", "confidence": 0.9}

用户请求：河西走廊一共多少集，更新完了吗
输出：{"domain": "vod", "intent": "slow_search", "tool": "vod_slow_search_data_search", "confidence": 0.9}

用户请求：即将上线的待播剧
输出：{"domain": "vod", "intent": "slow_search", "tool": "vod_slow_search_data_search", "confidence": 0.9}

用户请求：今年票房最高的电影是哪部
输出：{"domain": "vod", "intent": "slow_search", "tool": "vod_slow_search_data_search", "confidence": 0.9}

用户请求：["高分爱情电影", "这里面要最近的"]
输出：{"domain": "vod", "intent": "slow_search", "tool": "vod_slow_search_data_search", "confidence": 0.9}

用户请求：适合3到6岁孩子看的启蒙拼音课程
输出：{"domain": "educ", "intent": "slow_search", "tool": "educ_slow_search_data_search", "confidence": 0.9}

用户请求：“臣妾做不到啊”出自哪部电视剧
输出：{"domain": "vod", "intent": "clip", "tool": "vod_clip_search", "confidence": 0.9}

用户请求：那个警察退休后追查旧案的剧叫什么
输出：{"domain": "vod", "intent": "clip", "tool": "vod_clip_search", "confidence": 0.9}

用户请求：苏明玉逆袭那段是都挺好第几集
输出：{"domain": "vod", "intent": "clip", "tool": "vod_clip_search", "confidence": 0.9}

用户请求：2025 年古装剧的打斗场面盘点
输出：{"domain": "vod", "intent": "clip", "tool": "vod_clip_search", "confidence": 0.9}

